# (build 145) The armour seller's portrait (portrait 14, armor_seller) in
# Paseo's armour store (Building_ArmorStore), from its picture: one of the
# twelve no route drew after build 142 (see paseo_hospital_picture). The
# door's bytes (building 6, portrait 14, store row 5, stock 1), the stock
# list beside the portrait, B, the goodbye, the fade out.

start building 6 14 5 1 58 28       # the store; the street is 58,28
wait idle
expect script $0701                 # "Welcome to my shop!"
expect picture 56 64 armor_seller
shot 01_armor_seller
press b
wait idle
expect script $0708
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 58 28
expect picture 56 64 none
expect no-stderr not ported
